# Phishing Analysis – Cybersecurity Lab

## Overview
This repository contains a real-world phishing incident analysis
demonstrating entry-level cybersecurity skills, including:
- Incident documentation
- Attack analysis
- Business impact assessment
- Security control recommendations

## Skills Demonstrated
- Security analysis
- Threat modeling
- Risk assessment
- Security documentation
- Defensive thinking

## Tools Used
- Markdown
- GitHub
- Security frameworks (conceptual)

## Scenario
A credential phishing email targeting employees in a school district
was analyzed to assess risk, impact, and mitigation strategies.
